<title>USA: Columbia/HCA, Value Health merger OKd.</title>
<headline>Columbia/HCA, Value Health merger OKd.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Columbia/HCA Healthcare Corp and Value Health Inc said Tuesday they had received an order from the Calif. Department of Corporations allowing their proposed merger to be finalized.</p>
<p>The order represents the final regulatory hurdle needed by the two companies, who said they expect their merger to be completed this week.</p>
<p>Under the merger, Columbia/HCA will pay $20.50 in cash for each Value Health share of stock in a transaction valued at $1.2 billion.</p>
<p>Value Health shareholders approved the transaction on June 18.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
